{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Tales from the Workplace", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Interview", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Exchange information about people's interests and backgrounds using a wider range of language.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Simple Past Passive", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use an active structure when you want the \u2018doer' of the action to be the subject.<br/>You use a passive structure when you want the \u2018receiver' of the action to be the subject. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Active sentence = <span class=\"italic\">She</span> (subject) <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">instructed</span> her secretary</span> (object)<span class=\"italic\"> to join us.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Passive sentence = <span class=\"italic\">Her secretary</span> (subject) <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">was instructed</span> to join us</span> (by her). <br/>It is not necessary to mention the object in a passive sentence. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You make the passive form of a verb by using tenses of the verb <span class=\"italic\">to be</span> verb followed by the past participle.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The Simple Past passive form is: <br/> Subject + <span class=\"italic\">was</span>/<span class=\"italic\">were</span> + past participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">was handed</span> an application form.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I was handed an application form.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I was told to wait for a few minutes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I was ordered to look disappointed. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Using Modals to Add Meaning", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use modal verbs to add meaning to the main verb of a sentence. <br/> They help to provide a clearer picture or context to the reader or listener.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Some examples of modals are: <span class=\"italic\">should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span>.<br/>This group of modals add the meanings of advice, obligation or necessity.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "They come before the main verb of the sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the following chart with examples of each modal.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Should</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You <span class=\\\"strong\\\">should</span> follow my instructions without showing how you really feel. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Ought to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You <span class=\\\"strong\\\">ought to</span> sit in that chair there and face me.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Had better</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Strong Advice <br/>(Necessity)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Before you leave, you<span class=\\\"strong\\\">'d better</span> walk around the room.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Supposed to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Obligation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I was handed an application form which I was <span class=\\\"strong\\\">supposed to</span> fill out.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Notice the reduction of <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>. In speaking, it is normally reduced to <span class=\"italic\">'d better</span>.", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "application form", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a form you fill out when you apply for a job", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was handed an application form which I was supposed to fill out.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about jobs and work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "brief ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "short in length", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You had better give brief answers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "in a row", "type": "name"}, {"content": "one after the next", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She interrupted me if I said more than one sentence in a row.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "secretary ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who performs administrative tasks at a company", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Her secretary was instructed to join us and to take notes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to follow", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to obey", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should follow my instructions without showing how you really feel.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "disillusioned", "type": "name"}, {"content": "disappointed in someone or something that you discover to be worse than you had believed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Next, she told me to look angry and disillusioned.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "can't help (doing something)", "type": "name"}, {"content": "cannot avoid doing something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I tried to look sad, but I couldn't help smiling.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imagine that your friend has an important interview next week.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of things that your friend should and shouldn't do before the interview and during the interview.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write an email to your friend and give them suggestions for the interview.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Exchange emails with another student and decide if you agree with the advice they gave.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about jobs, work, rules and regulations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what a friend should, ought to, had better, or is supposed to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write an email with advice.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le06ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le06ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "When I arrived for my interview, I was handed an application form which I was supposed to fill out. When I finished, I was told to wait for a few minutes. An hour later, a woman opened the door to an office and called me in. Her secretary was instructed to join us and to take notes.\nShe said \u201cYou ought to sit in that chair there and face me.\u201d She started asking questions about my work experience. \u201cYou had better give brief answers\u201d. She interrupted me if I said more than one sentence in a row."}, {"image": "engenn8le06ob03re2img02.jpg", "time": "29200", "id": 2, "text": "<p>My interviewer suddenly asked me \u201cCould you please change the expression on your face? Look sad.\u201d I tried to look sad, but I couldn't help smiling. She told me not to smile.</p>\n<p>She said \u201cYou should follow my instructions without showing how you really feel.\u201d I was ordered to look disappointed. Next, she told me to look angry and disillusioned.</p>\n<p>\u201cBefore you leave, you'd better walk around the room\u201d, she said. Suddenly, she shouted not to move. I stood frozen like a statue and she walked around me.</p>"}, {"image": "engenn8le06ob03re2img03.jpg", "time": "59000", "id": 3, "text": "<p>\u201cWould you mind running around the room as if you were being chased?\u201d She ordered me to stop again. I had answered an ad that said, \"Interesting and Exciting Job\" and I was beginning to wonder what was going on.</p>\n<p>\u201cIt's been lovely talking to you, James. We'd like you to start right away\u201d.</p>\n<p>That's how I began my career as a photography model. </p>"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le06ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le06ob03re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs, work, rules and regulations. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about what I should, ought to, had better, or am supposed to do.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can keep a conversation going and build a professional relationship. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever had an interview that went badly? What happened?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What is the strangest experience you've had interviewing with someone?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "What a strange interview!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Let's read about a strange interview. Why did he stand <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">frozen like a statue</span>?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "typ